# cryptirc
===
 Self-hosted encrypted IRC client. Rust backend with 24/7 connectivity, Signal Protocol E2E for DMs, AES-256-GCM encrypted logs and channel keys. Native apps for Windows/Linux/macOS plus installable PWA for iOS/Android.
